-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Base model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DecisiveLM adapters run on Gemma 4 (E4B and 26B A4B), developed by Google DeepMind
and released under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No Gemma weights are included
in this repository. See https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E4B-it for the
model's own terms and model card.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No dataset is included in this repository. The datasets the code fetches, and the
models trained on them, keep their own licences. The attribution each licence
requires (authors, source, licence, and what was changed) is listed in
docs/guide/14-datasets.md, section 14.8, and the registry configs/datasets.yaml
records every source, licence and pinned file.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party text included in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
decisivelm/data/converters/jev_public.py reproduces, verbatim, the label names,
question instructions and item-sampling settings of two public benchmark
harnesses, so that their items can be rebuilt from the original datasets. No
model outputs from either harness are included or used.

